  "In[4662]:=",ExpressionUUID->"da02fbc2-378e-4ac3-8e17-dd3955f69ae7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Test helpers", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2a33610d-b8b6-4bff-8a3a-9ee1ebab9b21"],

Cell["\<\
Simplification recipes (from SM-4-point.nb):
  Higgs / massive fermion internals: SimplifySpinorProducts with \
InternalLines = channel pair, InternalLineOnShell, ExtractMandelstahm, \
Mass[i] replacements.
  Photon / gluon: Simplify the two helicity diagrams, ReducexFactors (default \
options), ExtractMandelstahm; same-flavour S+T compared with \
SimplifySpinorProducts (Schouten).
  Photon S-channel into WW: ComplexifyMomenta, ExpandXFactors, Unhat, \
ExtractMandelstahm (e E -> W- W+ cells). Compare the two-helicity sum.
  Z / W: ReduceSpinContractions then SimplifySpinorProducts \
(InternalLineOnShell). T/U: substitute the second channel momentum by \
conservation and SimplifySpinorProducts again; Collect in MZ. Replace \
Mass[Multiparticle[channel]] by the propagator mass. MW->MZ*CW on Z only.
  Fermion T with a vector plus Higgs (ff -> Zh T, ff -> Wh T): after \
simplifyChannel, rewrite Mom[1] by conservation and ReduceSpinorProducts \
(SM-4-point.nb ampTSimp). Tests set FermionTRewrite -> True. Expected keys \
may be \"e:T\" / \"e:U\" to select one channel of a mediator.
  Four-boson contact: ExtractMandelstahm of diagramAmplitude (no propagator). \
Higgs exchange uses simplifyChannel.
  ff -> gamma gamma (same helicity): ExpandXFactors, UnHatSpinors, Xi dummy \
replacement, then SimplifySpinorProducts (e E -> A.+ A.+ cells). Compare one \
channel (T or U), not the sum: each already equals the combined template.
  ff -> gamma+ gamma- (opposite helicity): ExpandXFactors, UnhatMomenta, \
replace dummy Xi by the other photon's helicity spinor, then per-channel \
on-shell identities (e E -> A.+ A.- cells). Compare the T+U sum after \
ExtractMandelstahm and 2 M1^2 - s13 - s14 -> s12.
  ff -> gamma h: ExpandXFactors, UnhatMomenta, replace dummy Xi by [3| and \
the other fermion momentum, [3|p_k|3> -> complementary PropDen, then on-shell \
MomProd identities (e E -> A.+ h cells). Compare one channel (T or U): each \
already equals the combined template.
  A.+ / G.+ f -> Z F: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by [1| and the \
other fermion momentum, [1|p_k|1> -> complementary PropDen, then S-channel \
on-shell identities (A.+ e -> Z E cells). Compare S, not the sum.
  h G.+ -> F f: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by [2| and a fermion \
momentum, [2|p_k|2> -> complementary PropDen, then T-channel on-shell \
identities (h G.+ -> U u cells). Compare T, not the sum.
  G.+ f -> A.+ F (same helicity): ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by \
the other massless vector's angle spinor, multiply by -[31]/[13], then \
per-channel on-shell identities (G.+ u -> A.+ U cells). Compare the S+U sum \
after ExtractMandelstahm, 2 Mf^2 - s12 - s14 -> s13, and 1/<13>[31] -> 1/s13.
  G.+ f -> A.- F (opposite helicity): ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace angle Xi \
by <3| and square Xi by [1|, then 1/<31>[13] -> 1/s13 (G.+ u -> A.- U cells). \
Compare the S+U sum after ExtractMandelstahm and 2 Mf^2 - s12 - s14 -> s13.
  A.+ W+ -> U d: ExpandXFactors, two complementary Xi replacements per \
diagram (test-nb ampSimpA/B then ampSimp2A/B), average all six, rewrite s12. \
Compare the S+T+U sum (SumAll).
  E ne -> A.+ W-: ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi by [3| and p1 (S) or p4 \
(T), [3|p_k|3> -> complementary PropDen, then the original rsp identities. \
Each of S and T equals the combined template. Use labels E ne A.+ W- (not e \
Ne A.+ W+).
  E ne -> Z W- and U d -> Z W+: ReduceSpinContractions then \
SimplifySpinorProducts, replace Mass[Multiparticle] by the propagator mass, \
S: p1.p2 -> (MW^2-M1^2-M2^2)/2, ExtractMandelstahm (test-nb cells). Each of \
S, T, and U equals its channel template. Use labels E ne Z W- and U d Z W+ \
(not the charge conjugates).
  Z h -> W- W+: ReduceSpinContractions then SimplifySpinorProducts, replace \
Mass[Multiparticle] by the propagator mass, then per-channel rsp identities \
(test-nb cells). T/U also apply the original comparison identities. Each of \
S, T, and U equals its channel template (opposite overall sign).
  A.+ A.+ -> W- W+: ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi by the photons' \
angle spinors (T: 1 then 2, U: 2 then 1), SSP, on-shell MomProd, then \
the T+U sum with 2 MW^2-s13-s14 -> s12 and [12]^2/[21]^2 * \
1/<12>^2[21]^2 -> 1/s12^2 (test-nb cells). Compare the T+U sum.
  A.+ A.- -> W- W+: ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi Angle by <2| and \
Square by [1|, then per-channel rsp identities (test-nb cells). T+U \
sum with 2 MW^2-s13-s14 -> s12 and 1/<12>[12] -> -1/s12. Compare the \
T+U sum.
  A.+ / G.+ W -> f f, and A.+ h -> W W T: replace xFactor by the \
crossed-channel identity (S: x_{2,34} -> -[1|p2p3|1]/(MW (s14-M4^2)), T: \
x_{24,3} -> -[1|p2p3|1]/(M3 (s14-M4^2)), U lepton: x_{4,23} -> [1|p2p3|1]/(M4 \
(s12-MW^2)), U quark: x_{4,23} -> [1|p3p2|1]/(M4 (s13-M3^2))), then \
InternalLineOnShell and the original rsp identities (A.+ W+ Ne e / U d, G.+ \
W+ U d cells). Lepton S and U, gluon-W T and U, and A.+ h -> WW T each equal \
the combined template. Use the original particle labels (A.+ W+ Ne e, not the \
charge conjugate).
  Massless fermion internals (ne Ne -> Z Z): align complementary \
Multiparticle helicity spinors, then the usual fermion reduction. Always \
replace Mass[Multiparticle] by the propagator mass, including 0.
Agreement is Simplify[got-exp] or Simplify[got+exp], then \
SimplifySpinorProducts followed by mReplacments (A.+ e -> Z E). PASS/FAIL \
prints as each comparison finishes.
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd25e4d3-22be-4b42-992e-82e29fd146ca"],

Cell["\<\
mediatorOf[d_] := Module[{props = Values[d[\"Propagators\"]], p},
  If[props === {}, Return[\"contact\"]];
  p = props[[1]][\"Particle\"];
  Which[
    MatchQ[p, \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"A\"], \"A\",
    MatchQ[p, \"G.+\" | \"G.-\" | \"G\"], \"G\",
    True, p
  ]
];

chMomenta[\"S\"] = {1, 2};
chMomenta[\"T\"] = {1, 3};
chMomenta[\"U\"] = {1, 4};

simplifyChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[{red, ss, rules},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  red = ReducexFactors[amp, ChannelMomenta -> chMomenta[ch], ChannelMass -> 0];
  ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[red,
    InternalLines -> chMomenta[ch],
    InternalLineOnShell -> True,
    PrintWarnings -> False,
    massReplacementRules -> rules,
    nTimes -> 8
  ];
  ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules
];

(* Z/W: ReduceSpinContractions first. T/U also rewrite the second
   channel momentum by conservation and Collect in the mass. *)
simplifyMassiveVectorChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {chM = chMomenta[ch], rules, ss, elim},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[
    ReduceSpinContractions[amp],
    InternalLines -> chM,
    InternalLineOnShell -> True,
    PrintWarnings -> False,
    massReplacementRules -> rules
  ];
  If[ch =!= \"S\",
    elim = Last[chM];
    ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[
      ss /. Mom[elim] -> -Total[Mom /@ DeleteCases[Range[4], elim]],
      PrintWarnings -> False
    ]
  ];
  ss = ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules;
  If[ch === \"S\", ss, Collect[ss, {MZ, MW}, FullSimplify]]
];

(* Photons: Simplify the two helicity diagrams first so the x-factor
   identities fire, then ReducexFactors with default ChannelMomenta. *)
simplifyPhotonChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] :=
  ExtractMandelstahm[ReducexFactors[Simplify[amp]]] /.
    Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];

(* Photon S-channel into WW: ComplexifyMomenta then ExpandXFactors so
   the two-helicity x-factor identity fires (e E -> W- W+ cells). *)
simplifyPhotonWWChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] :=
  Simplify[
    ExtractMandelstahm[
      UnHatSpinors[
        UnhatMomenta[
          ExpandXFactors[
            ComplexifyMomenta[Simplify[ReduceSpinContractions[amp]]],
            4]]]] /. Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses]
  ];

sameHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext_List] :=
  Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[{ext[[1]], ext[[2]]},
    {\"A.+\", \"A.+\"} | {\"A.-\", \"A.-\"}] &&
    MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]}, {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}];

oppositeHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext_List] :=
  Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[{ext[[1]], ext[[2]]},
    {\"A.+\", \"A.-\"} | {\"A.-\", \"A.+\"}] &&
    MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]}, {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}];

(* A.+ A.+ -> W- W+ (test-nb cells): ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi
   by the photons' angle spinors (T: 1 then 2, U: 2 then 1), SSP,
   on-shell MomProd, then the T+U sum with 2 MW^2-s13-s14 -> s12 and
   [12]^2/[21]^2 * 1/<12>^2[21]^2 -> 1/s12^2. Compare the T+U sum. *)
simplifyPhotonPhotonWWSameChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mw, xi1, xi2},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mw = masses[[3]];
  xi1 = If[ch === \"T\", 1, 2];
  xi2 = If[ch === \"T\", 2, 1];
  ss = ReduceSpinorProducts[
    UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[
      ReduceSpinContractions[amp], 4]]] /. {
        Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", \
xi1],
        Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 11] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", xi2]
      }
  ] /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mw,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mw,
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> mw
  } /. rules;
  ss = Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False] /. rules];
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = ss /. (MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> -MomProd[1, 3]) /.
      MomProd[1, 3] -> 0,
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> 0
  ];
  ss
];

(* A.+ A.- -> W- W+ (test-nb cells): ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi
   Angle by <2| and Square by [1|, then per-channel rsp identities.
   T+U sum with 2 MW^2-s13-s14 -> s12 and 1/<12>[12] -> -1/s12.
   Compare the T+U sum. *)
simplifyPhotonPhotonWWOppositeChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := \
Module[
  {ss, rules, mw},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mw = masses[[3]];
  ss = Simplify[ReduceSpinorProducts[
    UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[
      ReduceSpinContractions[amp], 4]]] /. {
        Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 2],
        Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Square\", 11] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1]
      }
  ] /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mw,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mw,
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> mw
  } /. rules];
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = Simplify[
   Expand[Expand[Expand[Expand[ss /. spPr[\"[132>^2[413>^2\"] -> \
((-rsp[\"<32>\"])*rsp[\"[4131]\"] + rsp[\"<331]\"]*rsp[\"[412>\"])^2] /. \
spPr[\"[412>\"] -> -rsp[\"[422>\"] - rsp[\"[432>\"] - rsp[\"[442>\"]] /. \
{spPr[\"[13]^2[432>\"] -> rsp[\"[13]\"]*((-rsp[\"<233]\"])*rsp[\"[41]\"] + \
rsp[\"<231]\"]*rsp[\"[43]\"]), spPr[\"[13]^2[432>^2\"] -> \
((-rsp[\"<233]\"])*rsp[\"[41]\"] + rsp[\"<231]\"]*rsp[\"[43]\"])^2, \
spPr[\"[13]<2132>\"] -> -rsp[\"<233]<211]\"] + \
rsp[\"<231]\"]*rsp[\"<213]\"]}] /. spPr[\"[14][312>\"] -> -rsp[\"<214][31]\"] \
+ rsp[\"<211]\"]*rsp[\"[34]\"] /. spPr[\"[412>\"] -> -rsp[\"[422>\"] - \
rsp[\"[432>\"] - rsp[\"[442>\"]] /. spPr[\"[13][432>\"] -> \
(-rsp[\"<233]\"])*rsp[\"[41]\"] + rsp[\"<231]\"]*rsp[\"[43]\"] /. MomProd[1, \
3] -> 0 /. rules],
    ss = Simplify[Expand[
    Expand[
       Expand[Expand[Expand[Expand[ReduceSpinorProducts[Expand[Simplify[
                          ss /. {spPr[\"<2134>\"] -> -rsp[\"<2234>\"] - \
rsp[\"<2334>\"] - rsp[\"<2434>\"]}] /. {MomProd[1, 3] + MomProd[3, 4] -> \
-MomProd[2, 3] - MW^2} /. MomProd[2, 3] -> 0 /. rules] /. Mom[1] -> -Mom[2] - \
Mom[3] - Mom[4]] /. MomProd[2, 3] -> 0 /. rules /. {spPr[\"<24>[123>\"] -> \
rsp[\"<34>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<32>[124>\"]} /. {spPr[\"<23>^2[124>\"] -> \
rsp[\"<23>\"]*(rsp[\"<43>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[123>\"]), spPr[\"[13][432>\"] \
-> -rsp[\"<233][41]\"] + rsp[\"<231][43]\"]}] /. {spPr[\"<23>[1231]\"] -> \
-rsp[\"[133>[122>\"] + rsp[\"[132>\"]*rsp[\"[123>\"], spPr[\"<23>[1234]\"] -> \
-rsp[\"[433>[122>\"] + rsp[\"[432>\"]*rsp[\"[123>\"]} /. {spPr[\"<24>[123>\"] \
-> rsp[\"<34>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<32>[124>\"]} /. spPr[\"[124>\"] -> \
-rsp[\"[134>\"] - rsp[\"[144>\"] /. rules] /. {spPr[\"<23>[134>\"] -> \
rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"], spPr[\"<23>^2[134>\"] -> \
rsp[\"<23>\"]*(rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"]), spPr[\"[13][432>\"] \
-> -rsp[\"<233][41]\"] + rsp[\"<231][43]\"]} /. rules] /. \
{spPr[\"[13][432>\"] -> -rsp[\"<233][41]\"] + rsp[\"<231][43]\"], \
spPr[\"[13]^2[432>\"] -> rsp[\"[13]\"]*(-rsp[\"<233][41]\"] + rsp[\"<231][43]\
\"])} /. rules] /. {spPr[\"[132>^2[324>^2\"] -> (-rsp[\"<42>[3231]\"] + \
rsp[\"<431][322>\"])^2} /. MomProd[2, 3] -> 0 /. {spPr[\"<24>^2[123>^2\"] -> \
(rsp[\"<34>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<32>[124>\"])^2} /. spPr[\"[124>\"] -> \
-rsp[\"[134>\"] - rsp[\"[144>\"] /. rules] /. {spPr[\"<23>^2[134>\"] -> \
rsp[\"<23>\"]*(rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"]), spPr[\"<23>^2[134>^2\
\"] -> (rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"])^2} /. rules]]
  ];
  ss
];

(* Fermion line with external photons/gluons: ExpandXFactors, UnHat,
   replace dummy Xi spinors (SM-4-point-test.nb e E -> A.+ A.+). Each
   of T and U already reduces to the full combined template. *)
simplifyFermionPhotonChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf, xiReplace, idents},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mf = masses[[1]];
  ss = ReduceSpinContractions[amp] /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ss, 4]] /. MomHat[a_] :> Mom[a];
  xiReplace = {
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 3], Mom[2], c],
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 11], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 4], Mom[1], c],
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 12], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 4], Mom[2], c],
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 13], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 3], Mom[1], c]
  };
  ss = ss /. xiReplace;
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> mf,
    Mass[1] -> masses[[1]], Mass[2] -> masses[[2]]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mom[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> Mom[4],
    Mom[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> Mom[3]
  };
  idents = {
    (spPr[\"[3243][4124]\"] -> rsp[\"[412423]\"]*rsp[\"[43]\"]) /.
      MomProd[2, 4] -> 0,
    (spPr[\"[3123][4234]\"] -> rsp[\"[423213]\"]*rsp[\"[43]\"]) /.
      MomProd[2, 3] -> 0
  };
  ss = FullSimplify[ExtractMandelstahm[SimplifySpinorProducts[ss /. idents,
    PrintWarnings -> False]]] /. rules;
  ss /. Mandelstahm[1, 2] + Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
    2*masses[[1]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 3]
];

oppositeHelicityPhotonPairQ[ext_List] :=
  Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]},
    {\"A.+\", \"A.-\"} | {\"A.-\", \"A.+\"} |
    {\"G.+\", \"G.-\"} | {\"G.-\", \"G.+\"}];

(* ff -> gamma+ gamma-: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by the
   other photon's helicity spinor (e E -> A.+ A.- cells). T and U each
   keep one propagator; the sum matches the combined template. *)
simplifyFermionPhotonOppositeChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, mf},
  mf = masses[[1]];
  ss = ReduceSpinContractions[amp] /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ss, 4]]];
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 4], c],
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Square\", n_], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 3], c]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> mf,
    Mass[2] -> mf
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mom[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> Mom[2],
    Mom[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> Mom[2]
  };
  ss = ss /. spPr[\"<423]\"] -> spPr[\"[324>\"];
  ss = ss /. spPr[\"1/(<43>[34])\"] ->
    1/PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], 0];
  ss = ss /. (spPr[\"<43>\"]*spPr[\"[34]\"]) ->
    PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], 0];
  ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False];
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"<4234>\"] -> -rsp[\"<4214>\"];
    ss = ss /. {MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> -mf^2 - MomProd[1, 3]};
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 3] -> 0,
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"[3243]\"] -> -rsp[\"[3213]\"];
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> 0
  ];
  Simplify[ss /. Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses]]
];

(* ff -> gamma h: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by the photon
   square spinor and the other fermion's momentum (e E -> A.+ h cells).
   Each of T and U already reduces to the full combined template. *)
simplifyFermionPhotonHiggsChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf, mh, xiMom},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mf = masses[[1]];
  mh = masses[[4]];
  ss = ReduceSpinContractions[amp] /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ss, 4]]];
  (* T: x_{1,24} -> Xi replaced by [3| p2; U: x_{14,2} -> [3| p1. *)
  xiMom = If[ch === \"T\", 2, 1];
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[b___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], c___] :>
      SpinorChain[b, Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 3], Mom[xiMom], c]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> mf, Mass[1] -> masses[[1]],
    Mass[2] -> masses[[2]]
  };
  ss = ss /. Mom[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> Mom[4];
  ss = ss /. {
    spPr[\"[323>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], mf],
    spPr[\"[313>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], mf]
  };
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"[3243]\"] -> -rsp[\"[3213]\"]
  ];
  ss = FullSimplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False]];
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = ss /. {MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> -MomProd[1, 3] - mf^2};
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 3] -> 0,
    ss = ss /. {MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 3] -> -MomProd[1, 4] - mf^2};
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> -mh^2/2
  ];
  FullSimplify[ExtractMandelstahm[ss]] /. rules
];

(* A.+ / G.+ f -> Z F: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by [1| and
   the other fermion's momentum (A.+ e -> Z E cells). S already reduces
   to the full combined template. *)
simplifyPhotonFermionZChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf, mz, xiMom},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mf = masses[[2]];
  mz = masses[[3]];
  xiMom = If[ch === \"S\", 4, 2];
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ReduceSpinContractions[amp], \
4]]];
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], a__] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1], Mom[xiMom], a]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    spPr[\"[141>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], mf],
    spPr[\"[121>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], mf]
  };
  ss = ss /. Mom[Multiparticle[3, 4]] -> Mom[3];
  ss = ss /. rules;
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[3, 4]] -> mf,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = FullSimplify[
    SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False] /.
      If[ch === \"S\", MomProd[1, 2] -> 0, MomProd[1, 4] -> 0] /. rules
  ];
  If[ch === \"S\",
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"[1341]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1321]\"];
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"[23][1231]\"] ->
      rsp[\"[13]\"]*rsp[\"[1232]\"] - rsp[\"[12]\"]*rsp[\"[1233]\"];
    ss = Simplify[ss] /. MomProd[2, 3] -> MomProd[1, 4] - mz^2/2
  ];
  ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules
];

(* h G.+ -> F f: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by [2| and a
   fermion momentum (h G.+ -> U u cells). T already reduces to the full
   combined template. *)
simplifyHiggsGluonFermionChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf, mh, xiMom},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mh = masses[[1]];
  mf = masses[[3]];
  xiMom = If[ch === \"T\", 3, 4];
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ReduceSpinContractions[amp], \
4]]];
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], a__] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 2], Mom[xiMom], a]
  };
  ss = ss /. SpinorChain[a___, Mom[3], Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], b___] :>
    SpinorChain[a, Mom[3], Mom[1], b];
  ss = ss /. spPr[\"[2432]\"] -> -rsp[\"[2132]\"];
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = ss /. rules;
  ss = ss /. {
    spPr[\"[232>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], mf],
    spPr[\"[242>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], mf]
  };
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False] /. rules;
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> -mh^2 - MomProd[1, 2] - MomProd[1, 3];
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 3] -> -mh^2/2;
    ss = Simplify[ExtractMandelstahm[ss]];
    ss = Expand[ss /. spPr[\"[214>\"] -> -rsp[\"[234>\"] - rsp[\"[244>\"]];
    ss = ss /. spPr[\"[213>[234>\"] ->
      -rsp[\"<43>\"]*rsp[\"[2312]\"] + rsp[\"<412]\"]*rsp[\"[233>\"];
    ss = Simplify[ss /. rules]
  ];
  ss
];

sameHelicityVector13Q[ext_List] :=
  Length[ext] >= 4 &&
    MatchQ[ext[[1]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"] &&
    MatchQ[ext[[3]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"] &&
    StringTake[ext[[1]], -1] === StringTake[ext[[3]], -1];

oppositeHelicityVector13Q[ext_List] :=
  Length[ext] >= 4 &&
    MatchQ[ext[[1]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"] &&
    MatchQ[ext[[3]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"] &&
    StringTake[ext[[1]], -1] =!= StringTake[ext[[3]], -1];

(* G.+ f -> A.+ F: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace dummy Xi by the other
   massless vector (G.+ u -> A.+ U cells). S and U each keep one
   propagator; the sum matches the combined template. *)
simplifyGluonPhotonSameChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mf = masses[[2]];
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ReduceSpinContractions[amp], \
4]]];
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], a___,
      Spinor[t_, \"Square\", 1], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 3], a,
        Spinor[t, \"Square\", 1], b],
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], a___,
      Spinor[t_, \"Square\", 3], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 1], a,
        Spinor[t, \"Square\", 3], b],
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], Spinor[t_, \"Angle\", 1]] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 3], Spinor[t, \"Angle\", 1]],
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], Spinor[t_, \"Angle\", 3]] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 1], Spinor[t, \"Angle\", \
3]]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[3, 4]] -> mf,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = ss /. rules;
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[a___, Mom[Multiparticle[3, 4]], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[a, Mom[4], b],
    SpinorChain[a___, Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[a, Mom[4], b]
  };
  ss = ss*(-spPr[\"[31]\"]/spPr[\"[13]\"]);
  ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False] /. rules;
  If[ch === \"S\",
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> -MomProd[1, 2] - MomProd[1, 3];
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 2] -> 0,
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 2] -> -MomProd[1, 3] - MomProd[1, 4];
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> 0
  ];
  Simplify[ss]
];

(* G.+ f -> A.- F: ExpandXFactors, Unhat, replace angle Xi by <3| and
   square Xi by [1| (G.+ u -> A.- U cells). S and U each keep one
   propagator; the sum matches the combined template. *)
simplifyGluonPhotonOppositeChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mf},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mf = masses[[2]];
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[ReduceSpinContractions[amp], \
4]]];
  ss = ss /. {
    Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Angle\", 3],
    Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Square\", n_] -> Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1]
  };
  ss = ss /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mf,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mf, Mass[Multiparticle[3, 4]] -> mf
  };
  ss = ss /. rules;
  ss = ss /. {
    SpinorChain[a___, Mom[Multiparticle[3, 4]], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[a, Mom[4], b],
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1],
      Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], b___] :>
      SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1], Mom[4], b]
  };
  ss = ss /. (1/spPr[\"<31>[13]\"]) -> 1/Mandelstahm[1, 3];
  ss = ss /. spPr[\"<341][143>\"] -> rsp[\"<321][123>\"];
  ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False];
  If[ch === \"S\",
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 2] -> 0,
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 4] -> 0
  ];
  Simplify[ss /. rules]
];

(* A.+ / G.+ W -> f f and A.+ h -> WW T: replace xFactor by the
   crossed-channel identity from SM-4-point.nb (A.+ W+ Ne e / U d,
   G.+ W+ U d). S/T (and lepton U) use InternalLineOnShell; then the
   original rsp identities. Each of lepton S and U, gluon-W T and U,
   and A.+ h -> WW T already equals the combined template. *)
simplifyPhotonWFermionChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, m2, m3, m4, intLines, leptonQ},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  m2 = masses[[2]]; m3 = masses[[3]]; m4 = masses[[4]];
  leptonQ = TrueQ[m3 == 0];
  ss = ReduceSpinContractions[amp] /. Join[
    {xFactor[2, Multiparticle[3, 4]] ->
      -spPr[\"[1|p2p3|1]\"]/(m2*(Mandelstahm[1, 4] - m4^2)),
     xFactor[4, Multiparticle[2, 3]] ->
      If[leptonQ,
        spPr[\"[1|p2p3|1]\"]/(m4*(Mandelstahm[1, 2] - m2^2)),
        spPr[\"[1|p3p2|1]\"]/(m4*(Mandelstahm[1, 3] - m3^2))
      ]},
    If[leptonQ, {},
      {xFactor[Multiparticle[2, 4], 3] ->
        -spPr[\"[1|p2p3|1]\"]/(m3*(Mandelstahm[1, 4] - m4^2))}
    ]
  ];
  intLines = Switch[ch,
    \"S\", {1, 2},
    \"T\", {1, 3},
    \"U\", If[leptonQ, {1, 4}, None],
    _, None
  ];
  ss = If[intLines === None,
    SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, PrintWarnings -> False],
    SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, InternalLines -> intLines,
      InternalLineOnShell -> True, PrintWarnings -> False]
  ];
  ss = ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> m2,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> m3,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m4
  };
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = Expand[ss /. rsp[\"[123>\"] ->
      -rsp[\"[113>\"] - rsp[\"[133>\"] - rsp[\"[143>\"]];
    ss = ss /. rsp[\"<24>[143>\"] ->
      rsp[\"<34>[142>\"] - rsp[\"<32>[144>\"]
  ];
  ss = ss /. rsp[\"[132>\"] ->
    -rsp[\"[112>\"] - rsp[\"[122>\"] - rsp[\"[142>\"];
  ss = ss /. rsp[\"<34>[142>\"] ->
    rsp[\"<24>[143>\"] - rsp[\"<23>[144>\"];
  ss = Simplify[ss /. rules];
  If[ch === \"U\" && !leptonQ,
    ss = ss /. (Mandelstahm[1, 4]*rsp[\"[13]\"]) -> m4^2*rsp[\"[13]\"]
  ];
  Simplify[ss]
];

(* A.+ W+ -> U d (SM-4-point-test.nb cells): ExpandXFactors, unify Xi,
   then two complementary Xi replacements (p3 vs p4, or p2 vs the
   other fermion) per diagram, fold each into the template spinor, and
   average all six. Compare the sum of S+T+U, not one channel. *)
xiReplaceMom[mom_] := With[{m = mom},
  SpinorChain[a___, Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10]] :>
    SpinorChain[a, Mom[m], Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 1]]];
awffPost2[ss_, extra_] := Simplify[
  ExtractMandelstahm[Expand[
    extra[ExtractMandelstahm[ss /.
      spPr[\"[23][1231]\"] -> rsp[\"[13]\"]*rsp[\"[1232]\"] -
        rsp[\"[12]\"]*rsp[\"[1233]\"]] /. mReplacments]
  ]] /. {
    spPr[\"[123>\"] -> -rsp[\"[133>\"] - rsp[\"[143>\"],
    spPr[\"[132>\"] -> -rsp[\"[122>\"] - rsp[\"[142>\"]
  } /. mReplacments
];
simplifyQuarkAWffCombined[diags_List, masses_List] := Module[
  {m2, m3, m4, amps, a1, b1, a2, b2, a3, b3, a1p, b1p, a2p, b2p, a3p, b3p},
  {m2, m3, m4} = masses[[{2, 3, 4}]];
  amps = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[
    ReduceSpinContractions[diagramAmplitudes[diags][[All, 2]]], 4]]];
  amps = amps /. {
    Mass[Multiparticle[2, 4]] -> m3, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> m2,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> m3, Mass[Multiparticle[3, 4]] -> m2,
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m4, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> m4
  } /. mReplacments;
  amps = amps /. {
    Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 11] -> Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10],
    Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 12] -> Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", 10]
  };
  a1 = Expand[SimplifySpinorProducts[
    Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[1]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
      MomProd[1, 2] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /. xiReplaceMom[3] /.
      (spPr[\"<131]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], m3]),
    PrintWarnings -> False] /. mReplacments /.
      (MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> -MomProd[1, 3]) /.
      (MomProd[1, 3] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], m3]/2)
  ] /. (spPr[\"[1341]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1321]\"]);
  a1p = awffPost2[a1, Function[s,
    s /. Mandelstahm[1, 4] -> -Mandelstahm[1, 3] + m3^2 + m4^2 /.
      Mandelstahm[1, 3] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], m3] + m3^2]];
  b1 = Expand[SimplifySpinorProducts[
    Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[1]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
      MomProd[1, 2] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /. xiReplaceMom[4] /.
      (spPr[\"<141]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4]),
    PrintWarnings -> False] /. MomProd[1, 2] -> 0 /. mReplacments /.
      (MomProd[1, 4] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4]/2)
  ] /. (spPr[\"[1341]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1321]\"]);
  b1p = awffPost2[b1, Function[s,
    s /. Mandelstahm[1, 4] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4] + m4^2]];
  a2 = Expand[
    Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[2]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
      MomProd[1, 3] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /.
      (MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> 0) /. xiReplaceMom[2] /.
      {Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m4, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> m4} /.
      (spPr[\"[1221]\"] -> 0) /.
      (spPr[\"<121]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], m2]) /.
      (spPr[\"[1321]\"] -> rsp[\"[1321]\"]) /.
      (spPr[\"[3121]\"] -> rsp[\"[3121]\"]) /.
      (MomProd[1, 2] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], m2]/2)
  ];
  a2p = awffPost2[a2, Function[s,
    s /. Mandelstahm[1, 4] -> -Mandelstahm[1, 2] + m4^2 + m2^2 /.
      Mandelstahm[1, 2] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], m2] + m2^2]];
  b2 = Expand[SimplifySpinorProducts[
    Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[2]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
      MomProd[1, 3] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /. xiReplaceMom[4] /.
      (spPr[\"<141]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4]),
    PrintWarnings -> False] /. mReplacments /.
      (MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> 0)
  ] /. (MomProd[1, 4] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4]/2) /.
    (spPr[\"[1341]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1321]\"]);
  b2p = awffPost2[b2, Function[s,
    s /. Mandelstahm[1, 4] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]], m4] + m4^2]];
  a3 = Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[3]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
    MomProd[1, 4] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /. xiReplaceMom[2] /.
    {Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m4, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> m4} /.
    (spPr[\"[1221]\"] -> 0) /.
    (spPr[\"<121]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], m2]) /.
    (spPr[\"[1321]\"] -> rsp[\"[1321]\"]);
  a3p = Simplify[Expand[ExtractMandelstahm[
    (a3 /. spPr[\"[23][1231]\"] -> rsp[\"[13]\"]*rsp[\"[1232]\"] -
      rsp[\"[12]\"]*rsp[\"[1233]\"] /.
      MomProd[2, 3] -> (m4^2 - m2^2 - m3^2)/2) /. mReplacments
  ]] /. {spPr[\"[123>\"] -> -rsp[\"[133>\"] - rsp[\"[143>\"],
    spPr[\"[132>\"] -> -rsp[\"[122>\"] - rsp[\"[142>\"]} /. mReplacments];
  b3 = Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[amps[[3]], PrintWarnings -> False] /.
    MomProd[1, 4] -> 0 /. mReplacments] /. xiReplaceMom[3] /.
    {Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m4, Mass[Multiparticle[2, 3]] -> m4} /.
    (spPr[\"[1331]\"] -> 0) /.
    (spPr[\"<131]\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], m3]) /.
    (spPr[\"[1321]\"] -> rsp[\"[1321]\"]);
  b3p = Simplify[Expand[ExtractMandelstahm[
    (b3 /. spPr[\"[23][1231]\"] -> rsp[\"[13]\"]*rsp[\"[1232]\"] -
      rsp[\"[12]\"]*rsp[\"[1233]\"] /. mReplacments /.
      MomProd[2, 3] -> (m4^2 - m2^2 - m3^2)/2)
  ]] /. {spPr[\"[123>\"] -> -rsp[\"[133>\"] - rsp[\"[143>\"],
    spPr[\"[132>\"] -> -rsp[\"[122>\"] - rsp[\"[142>\"]} /. mReplacments];
  FullSimplify[(a1p + a2p + a3p + b1p + b2p + b3p)/3 /.
    Mandelstahm[1, 2] -> -Mandelstahm[1, 3] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] +
      m2^2 + m3^2 + m4^2]
];

(* E ne -> A.+ W- (test-nb cells): ExpandXFactors, replace dummy Xi by
   [3| and p1 (S) or p4 (T), [3|p_k|3> -> complementary PropDen, then
   the original rsp identities. Each of S and T equals the combined
   template. *)
simplifyFermionPhotonWChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, me, mw, xiMom},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  me = masses[[1]]; mw = masses[[4]];
  xiMom = If[ch === \"S\", 1, 4];
  ss = UnhatMomenta[UnHatSpinors[ExpandXFactors[
    SimplifySpinorProducts[ReduceSpinContractions[amp],
      PrintWarnings -> False], 4]]];
  ss = ss /. SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Xi\", \"Angle\", n_], a__] :>
    SpinorChain[Spinor[\"Helicity\", \"Square\", 3], Mom[xiMom], a];
  ss = ss /. {
    spPr[\"[313>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]], me],
    spPr[\"[343>\"] -> PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[1, 2]], mw]
  } /. rules /. Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mw;
  If[ch === \"S\",
    ss = Simplify[Expand[Expand[
      ReduceSpinorProducts[ss /. Mom[1] -> -Mom[2] - Mom[3] - Mom[4]] /.
        (spPr[\"<24>[3243]\"] -> -rsp[\"[344>\"]*rsp[\"[322>\"] +
          rsp[\"[342>\"]*rsp[\"[324>\"]) /.
        (spPr[\"[342>\"] -> -rsp[\"[312>\"] - rsp[\"[322>\"] -
          rsp[\"[332>\"]) /.
        (spPr[\"[312>[124>\"] -> -rsp[\"<42>\"]*rsp[\"[1213]\"] +
          rsp[\"<413]\"]*rsp[\"[122>\"]) /.
        (MomProd[1, 2] -> (mw^2 - me^2)/2) /. rules
    ] /. (spPr[\"<24>[321>\"] -> rsp[\"<14>\"]*rsp[\"[322>\"] -
        rsp[\"<12>\"]*rsp[\"[324>\"]) /.
      (spPr[\"[324>^2\"] -> -spPr[\"[324>\"]*(rsp[\"[314>\"] +
        rsp[\"[334>\"] + rsp[\"[344>\"])) /. rules
    ] /. (spPr[\"<12>[314>\"] -> rsp[\"<42>\"]*rsp[\"[311>\"] -
      rsp[\"<41>\"]*rsp[\"[312>\"]) /. rules],
    ss = Simplify[Simplify[Expand[
      Simplify[ReduceSpinorProducts[ss] /. MomProd[1, 3] -> 0 /. rules] /.
        {MomProd[1, 4] + MomProd[3, 4] -> (-me^2 - mw^2)/2} /.
        (spPr[\"[3143]\"] -> -rsp[\"[3243]\"] - rsp[\"[3343]\"] -
          rsp[\"[3443]\"]) /.
        (spPr[\"<24>[3243]\"] -> -rsp[\"[344>\"]*rsp[\"[322>\"] +
          rsp[\"[342>\"]*rsp[\"[324>\"]) /.
        (spPr[\"[314>^2\"] -> -rsp[\"[314>\"]*(rsp[\"[324>\"] +
          rsp[\"[334>\"] + rsp[\"[344>\"])) /. rules
    ] /. (spPr[\"[342>\"] -> -rsp[\"[312>\"]) /.
      (spPr[\"<14>[312>\"] -> rsp[\"<24>\"]*rsp[\"[311>\"] -
        rsp[\"<21>\"]*rsp[\"[314>\"]) /. rules
    ] /. (spPr[\"[314>\"] -> -rsp[\"[324>\"] - rsp[\"[334>\"] -
      rsp[\"[344>\"]) /. rules]
  ];
  ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules
];

(* E ne -> Z W- / U d -> Z W+ (test-nb cells): ReduceSpinContractions,
   SimplifySpinorProducts, Mass[Multiparticle] -> propagator mass,
   S: MomProd[1,2] -> (MW^2-M1^2-M2^2)/2, ExtractMandelstahm. Each of
   S, T, and U equals its channel template. Use labels E ne Z W- and
   U d Z W+ (not the charge conjugates). *)
simplifyFermionZWChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, m1, m2, mw},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  m1 = masses[[1]]; m2 = masses[[2]]; mw = masses[[4]];
  ss = Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[ReduceSpinContractions[amp],
    PrintWarnings -> False] /. rules /. {
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mw,
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> m1,
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> m2
    }];
  If[ch === \"S\",
    ss = ss /. MomProd[1, 2] -> (mw^2 - m1^2 - m2^2)/2
  ];
  ExtractMandelstahm[ss]
];

(* Z h -> W- W+ (test-nb cells): ReduceSpinContractions,
   SimplifySpinorProducts, Mass[Multiparticle] -> propagator mass,
   then per-channel rsp identities. T/U also apply the original
   comparison identities so each channel matches its template
   (opposite overall sign). *)
zhWWFinalize[ss_, ch_String] := Module[{s = ss},
  If[ch === \"S\", Return[s]];
  s = FullSimplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[s, PrintWarnings -> False] /. \
mReplacments];
  If[ch === \"T\",
    s = Expand[s /. {
      spPr[\"[14][314>\"] -> -rsp[\"<414]\"]*rsp[\"[31]\"] +
        rsp[\"<411]\"]*rsp[\"[34]\"],
      spPr[\"[34][131>\"] -> -rsp[\"<134]\"]*rsp[\"[13]\"] +
        rsp[\"<133]\"]*rsp[\"[14]\"]
    } /. mReplacments];
    s = Expand[s /. (spPr[\"<34>[431>\"] -> rsp[\"<14>\"]*rsp[\"[433>\"] -
      rsp[\"<13>\"]*rsp[\"[434>\"])];
    s = ReduceSpinorProducts[s /. Mom[2] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[3] - Mom[4]];
    Return[Expand[s /. (spPr[\"<34>[431>\"] -> rsp[\"<14>\"]*rsp[\"[433>\"] -
      rsp[\"<13>\"]*rsp[\"[434>\"]) /. mReplacments]]
  ];
  s = ReduceSpinorProducts[s /. Mom[2] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[3] - Mom[4]] /. \
mReplacments;
  s = Expand[s /. (spPr[\"<34>[141>\"] -> rsp[\"<14>\"]*rsp[\"[143>\"] -
    rsp[\"<13>\"]*rsp[\"[144>\"]) /. mReplacments];
  s = Expand[s /. (spPr[\"[34][143>\"] -> -rsp[\"<344]\"]*rsp[\"[13]\"] +
    rsp[\"<343]\"]*rsp[\"[14]\"]) /. mReplacments];
  s = Expand[s /. (spPr[\"<13>[314>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>\"]*rsp[\"[311>\"] -
    rsp[\"<41>\"]*rsp[\"[313>\"]) /. mReplacments];
  Expand[s /. {
    spPr[\"<34>[341>\"] -> rsp[\"<14>[343>\"] - rsp[\"<13>[344>\"],
    spPr[\"[13][413>\"] -> -rsp[\"<313][41]\"] + rsp[\"<311][43]\"]
  } /. mReplacments]
];

simplifyZhWWChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mz, mw},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mz = masses[[1]]; mw = masses[[3]];
  ss = Simplify[SimplifySpinorProducts[ReduceSpinContractions[amp],
    PrintWarnings -> False] /. rules /. {
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 2]] -> mz,
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mw,
      Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mw
    }];
  ss = Switch[ch,
    \"S\",
      Simplify[Expand[
        ReduceSpinorProducts[ss /. Mom[2] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[3] - Mom[4]] /.
          (MomProd[3, 4] -> (mz^2 - 2*mw^2)/2) /. rules
      ] /. {
        spPr[\"<13>[134>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>\"]*rsp[\"[131>\"] -
          rsp[\"<41>\"]*rsp[\"[133>\"],
        spPr[\"<14>[143>\"] -> rsp[\"<34>\"]*rsp[\"[141>\"] -
          rsp[\"<31>\"]*rsp[\"[144>\"]
      } /. rules],
    \"T\",
      Simplify[Expand[
        Simplify[ReduceSpinorProducts[ss /. Mom[1] -> -Mom[2] - Mom[3] -
          Mom[4]]] /. (MomProd[1, 2] + MomProd[1, 4] -> -mz^2/2) /. rules
      ] /. {
        spPr[\"[34][131>\"] -> -rsp[\"<134]\"]*rsp[\"[13]\"] +
          rsp[\"<133]\"]*rsp[\"[14]\"],
        spPr[\"<14>[423>\"] -> rsp[\"<34>\"]*rsp[\"[421>\"] -
          rsp[\"<31>\"]*rsp[\"[424>\"]
      } /. rules],
    \"U\",
      Expand[ss /. (MomProd[1, 4] -> -mz^2/2)],
    _, ss
  ];
  zhWWFinalize[ExtractMandelstahm[ss], ch]
];

(* A.+ Z -> W- W+ (SM-4-point.nb U channel): xFactor identity
   x_{4,23} -> -[1|p3p4|1]/(MW (s13-MW^2)), InternalLineOnShell, then
   the original ampUSimpA..I chain. U equals the combined template after
   MW->MZ CW (T was labeled broken in the original notebook). Compare
   U only, not T+U. *)
simplifyPhotonZWWChannel[amp_, ch_String, masses_List] := Module[
  {ss, rules, mw, mz, massRules, unoX, a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h, i},
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  mw = masses[[3]]; mz = masses[[2]];
  massRules = Join[rules, {
    Mass[Multiparticle[1, 3]] -> mw, Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mw,
    Mandelstahm[1, 4] -> mw^2}];
  ss = ReduceSpinContractions[amp] /. {
    Mom[1] + Mom[4] -> Mom[Multiparticle[1, 4]],
    Mom[1] + Mom[3] -> Mom[Multiparticle[1, 3]]
  };
  If[ch === \"T\",
    ss = ss /. xFactor[Multiparticle[2, 4], 3] ->
      spPr[\"[1|p3p2|1]\"]/(mw*(Mandelstahm[1, 4] - mw^2));
    ss = SimplifySpinorProducts[ss, InternalLines -> {1, 3},
      InternalLineOnShell -> True, PrintWarnings -> False];
    Return[ExtractMandelstahm[ss] /. rules /. MW -> MZ*CW]
  ];
  ss = ExtractMandelstahm[SimplifySpinorProducts[ss,
    InternalLines -> {1, 4}, InternalLineOnShell -> True,
    PrintWarnings -> False]] /. rules /. Mass[Multiparticle[1, 4]] -> mw;
  unoX = ss /. xFactor[4, Multiparticle[2, 3]] ->
    -spPr[\"[1|p3p4|1]\"]/(mw*(Mandelstahm[1, 3] - mw^2));
  a = Expand[ExtractMandelstahm[SimplifySpinorProducts[
    Numerator[unoX/EE^2], InternalLines -> {1, 4},
    InternalLineOnShell -> True, PrintWarnings -> False]] /. massRules];
  b = Expand[ExtractMandelstahm[a /. {
      spPr[\"[23][1|p3p4|1]\"] -> spPr[\"[13][1|p3p4|2]\"] -
        rsp[\"[12][1|p3p4|3]\"],
      spPr[\"[24][1|p3p4|1]\"] -> spPr[\"[14][1|p3p4|2]\"] -
        rsp[\"[12][1|p3p4|4]\"]
    } /. (spPr[\"[1|p3p4|2]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1|p3p1|2]\"] -
      rsp[\"[1|p3p2|2]\"] - rsp[\"[1|p3p3|2]\"])] /. massRules];
  c = Expand[ReduceSpinorProducts[b /. Mom[4] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[2] -
    Mom[3]] /. Mandelstahm[1, 3] -> -Mandelstahm[1, 2] + mw^2 + mz^2 /.
    massRules];
  d = Expand[ReduceSpinorProducts[c /. {
      spPr[\"<23>[124>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[123>\"],
      spPr[\"<23>[134>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"]
    } /. {Mom[2] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[3] - Mom[4],
      Mom[3] -> -Mom[1] - Mom[2] - Mom[4]}] /. massRules];
  e = Expand[ReduceSpinorProducts[d /. {
      spPr[\"<24>[143>\"] -> rsp[\"<34>[142>\"] - rsp[\"<32>[144>\"],
      spPr[\"<24>^2[143>\"] -> rsp[\"<24><34>[142>\"] -
        rsp[\"<24><32>[144>\"]
    } /. Mom[1] -> -Mom[2] - Mom[3] - Mom[4]] /. massRules];
  f = Expand[e /. {
      spPr[\"[14]^2[243>\"] -> -rsp[\"[14]<344][21]\"] +
        rsp[\"[14]<341][24]\"],
      spPr[\"[13][434>\"] -> -rsp[\"<433][41]\"] + rsp[\"<431][43]\"],
      spPr[\"[12][424>\"] -> -rsp[\"<422][41]\"] + rsp[\"<421][42]\"],
      spPr[\"[14][243>\"] -> -rsp[\"<344][21]\"] + rsp[\"<341][24]\"]
    } /. massRules];
  g = Expand[f /. {
      spPr[\"[142>\"] -> -rsp[\"[112>\"] - rsp[\"[122>\"] - rsp[\"[132>\"],
      spPr[\"[143>\"] -> -rsp[\"[113>\"] - rsp[\"[123>\"] - rsp[\"[133>\"]
    } /. {
      spPr[\"<23>[124>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>[122>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[123>\"],
      spPr[\"<23>[134>\"] -> rsp[\"<43>[132>\"] - rsp[\"<42>[133>\"]
    } /. massRules];
  h = Expand[Expand[g /. {
      spPr[\"[14][23]\"] -> rsp[\"[34][21]\"] - rsp[\"[31][24]\"],
      spPr[\"[14]^2[23]\"] -> rsp[\"[14][34][21]\"] - rsp[\"[14][31][24]\"]
    }] /. (spPr[\"[12]^2[34]\"] -> rsp[\"[12][42][31]\"] -
      rsp[\"[12][41][32]\"])];
  i = Expand[ExtractMandelstahm[
    Expand[h /. spPr[\"[132>\"] -> (-1/mz)*spPr[\"[1322]\"]] /.
      (spPr[\"[34][1322]\"] -> rsp[\"[24][1323]\"] - rsp[\"[23][1324]\"]) /.
      (spPr[\"[1234]\"] -> -rsp[\"[1134]\"] - rsp[\"[1334]\"] -
        rsp[\"[1434]\"])] /. massRules];
  FullSimplify[EE^2*(i/Denominator[unoX]) /. MW -> MZ*CW]
];

agreeUpToSign[got_, expected_] := Module[{diff, sum},
  diff = TimeConstrained[Simplify[got - expected], 30, $TimedOut];
  If[diff === 0, Return[\"PASS (same sign)\"]];
  sum = TimeConstrained[Simplify[got + expected], 30, $TimedOut];
  If[sum === 0, Return[\"PASS (opposite overall sign)\"]];
  diff = TimeConstrained[
    SimplifySpinorProducts[got - expected, PrintWarnings -> False] /. \
mReplacments, 30, $TimedOut];
  If[diff === 0, Return[\"PASS (same sign)\"]];
  sum = TimeConstrained[
    SimplifySpinorProducts[got + expected, PrintWarnings -> False] /. \
mReplacments, 30, $TimedOut];
  If[sum === 0, Return[\"PASS (opposite overall sign)\"]];
  Module[{s12id},
    s12id = Mandelstahm[1, 2] -> -Mandelstahm[1, 3] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] +
      Total[(Mass /@ Range[4])^2 /. mReplacments];
    diff = TimeConstrained[FullSimplify[ExtractMandelstahm[
      SimplifySpinorProducts[got - expected, PrintWarnings -> False]] /.
      mReplacments /. s12id], 30, $TimedOut];
    If[diff === 0, Return[\"PASS (same sign)\"]];
    sum = TimeConstrained[FullSimplify[ExtractMandelstahm[
      SimplifySpinorProducts[got + expected, PrintWarnings -> False]] /.
      mReplacments /. s12id], 30, $TimedOut];
    If[sum === 0, Return[\"PASS (opposite overall sign)\"]]
  ];
  If[diff === $TimedOut || sum === $TimedOut, Return[\"TIMEOUT\"]];
  \"FAIL\"
];

statusStyle[s_String] := Style[s, Bold, Which[
  StringStartsQ[s, \"PASS\"], Darker[Green],
  StringStartsQ[s, \"FAIL\"], Red,
  True, Black
]];

diagramsFor[parts_List] := CreateDiagrams[parts, sm];

parseMedKey[key_String] := If[StringContainsQ[key, \":\"],
  StringSplit[key, \":\", 2],
  {key, All}
];

sumMediator[diags_List, med_String, masses_List, ch_:All, fermT_:False] := \
Module[
  {sel, byCh, simp, tot, propMass, rules},
  sel = Select[diags, mediatorOf[#] === med &];
  If[ch =!= All, sel = Select[sel, diagramChannel[#] === ch &]];
  If[sel === {}, Return[0]];
  rules = Thread[Mass /@ Range[4] -> masses];
  If[med === \"contact\",
    Return[ExtractMandelstahm[Total[diagramAmplitude /@ sel]] /. rules]
  ];
  byCh = GroupBy[sel, diagramChannel];
  simp[c_] := Module[{amp = Total[diagramAmplitude /@ byCh[c]], ss, ext, s2,
    ferm12, vv34, vh34, oppHel, ww34, afzf, hgff, gapp, gappOpp, fermionMed,
    awff, ffaw, ffzw, zhww, aawwpp, aawwpm, azww},
    ext = Lookup[sel[[1]], \"ExternalParticles\", {}];
    s2 = Lookup[sel[[1]], \"Spin2\", <||>];
    ferm12 = Length[ext] >= 4 && Lookup[s2, ext[[1]], 0] === 1 &&
      Lookup[s2, ext[[2]], 0] === 1;
    vv34 = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[ext[[3]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \
\"G.-\"] && MatchQ[ext[[4]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"];
    vh34 = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[ext[[3]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \
\"G.-\"] && MatchQ[ext[[4]], \"h\"];
    ww34 = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]},
      {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}];
    afzf = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[ext[[1]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \
\"G.-\"] && ext[[3]] === \"Z\";
    hgff = Length[ext] >= 4 && ext[[1]] === \"h\" &&
      MatchQ[ext[[2]], \"G.+\" | \"G.-\"];
    awff = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[ext[[1]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\" | \"G.+\" | \
\"G.-\"] && (MatchQ[ext[[2]], \"W+\" | \"W-\"] ||
      (ext[[2]] === \"h\" && MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]},
        {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}]));
    ffaw = Length[ext] >= 4 && ferm12 &&
      MatchQ[ext[[3]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\"] && MatchQ[ext[[4]], \"W+\" | \"W-\"];
    ffzw = Length[ext] >= 4 && ferm12 &&
      ext[[3]] === \"Z\" && MatchQ[ext[[4]], \"W+\" | \"W-\"];
    zhww = Length[ext] >= 4 && ext[[1]] === \"Z\" && ext[[2]] === \"h\" &&
      MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]}, {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}];
    aawwpp = sameHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext];
    aawwpm = oppositeHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext];
    azww = Length[ext] >= 4 && MatchQ[ext[[1]], \"A.+\" | \"A.-\"] &&
      ext[[2]] === \"Z\" && MatchQ[{ext[[3]], ext[[4]]},
        {\"W-\", \"W+\"} | {\"W+\", \"W-\"}];
    gapp = sameHelicityVector13Q[ext];
    gappOpp = oppositeHelicityVector13Q[ext];
    oppHel = oppositeHelicityPhotonPairQ[ext];
    fermionMed = med =!= \"A\" && med =!= \"G\" && med =!= \"Z\" && med =!= \
\"h\" && med =!= \"contact\" && !StringStartsQ[med, \"W\"];
    ss = Which[
      azww, simplifyPhotonZWWChannel[amp, c, masses],
      aawwpm, simplifyPhotonPhotonWWOppositeChannel[amp, c, masses],
      aawwpp, simplifyPhotonPhotonWWSameChannel[amp, c, masses],
      zhww, simplifyZhWWChannel[amp, c, masses],
      ffzw, simplifyFermionZWChannel[amp, c, masses],
      ffaw, simplifyFermionPhotonWChannel[amp, c, masses],
      awff, simplifyPhotonWFermionChannel[amp, c, masses],
      fermionMed && gappOpp, simplifyGluonPhotonOppositeChannel[amp, c, \
masses],
      fermionMed && gapp, simplifyGluonPhotonSameChannel[amp, c, masses],
      fermionMed && hgff, simplifyHiggsGluonFermionChannel[amp, c, masses],
      fermionMed && afzf, simplifyPhotonFermionZChannel[amp, c, masses],
      fermionMed && ferm12 && vh34, simplifyFermionPhotonHiggsChannel[amp, c, \
masses],
      fermionMed && ferm12 && oppHel, \
simplifyFermionPhotonOppositeChannel[amp, c, masses],
      fermionMed && ferm12 && vv34, simplifyFermionPhotonChannel[amp, c, \
masses],
      med === \"A\" && ww34, simplifyPhotonWWChannel[amp, c, masses],
      med === \"A\" || med === \"G\", simplifyPhotonChannel[amp, c, masses],
      med === \"Z\" || StringStartsQ[med, \"W\"], \
simplifyMassiveVectorChannel[amp, c, masses],
      True, simplifyChannel[amp, c, masses]
    ];
    If[TrueQ[fermT] && c === \"T\" && med =!= \"A\" && med =!= \"G\" && med \
=!= \"Z\" && !StringStartsQ[med, \"W\"] && med =!= \"h\",
      ss = ReduceSpinorProducts[ss /. Mom[1] -> -Total[Mom /@ {2, 3, 4}]] /. \
rules
    ];
    ss
  ];
  tot = Total[simp /@ Keys[byCh]];
  Module[{ext0 = Lookup[sel[[1]], \"ExternalParticles\", {}], fermionMed0},
    fermionMed0 = med =!= \"A\" && med =!= \"G\" && med =!= \"Z\" &&
      med =!= \"h\" && med =!= \"contact\" && !StringStartsQ[med, \"W\"];
    If[oppositeHelicityPhotonPairQ[ext0] && fermionMed0,
      tot = FullSimplify[ExtractMandelstahm[tot]] /. {
        2*masses[[1]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 3] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
          Mandelstahm[1, 2]
      }
    ];
    If[sameHelicityVector13Q[ext0] && fermionMed0,
      tot = Simplify[ExtractMandelstahm[tot]] /. {
        2*masses[[2]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 2] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
          Mandelstahm[1, 3]
      };
      tot = tot*(-spPr[\"[13]\"]/spPr[\"[31]\"]);
      tot = tot /. {
        1/(spPr[\"<13>\"]*spPr[\"[31]\"]) -> 1/Mandelstahm[1, 3],
        1/spPr[\"<13>[31]\"] -> 1/Mandelstahm[1, 3]
      }
    ];
    If[oppositeHelicityVector13Q[ext0] && fermionMed0,
      tot = Simplify[ExtractMandelstahm[tot]] /. {
        2*masses[[2]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 2] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
          Mandelstahm[1, 3]
      }
    ];
    If[sameHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext0],
      tot = Simplify[ExtractMandelstahm[tot]] /. {
        2*masses[[3]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 3] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
          Mandelstahm[1, 2]
      };
      tot = tot*(spPr[\"[12]^2\"]/spPr[\"[21]^2\"]);
      tot = tot /. {
        1/spPr[\"<12>^2[21]^2\"] :> 1/Mandelstahm[1, 2]^2
      }
    ];
    If[oppositeHelicityPhotonWWQ[ext0],
      tot = Simplify[ExtractMandelstahm[tot]] /. {
        2*masses[[3]]^2 - Mandelstahm[1, 3] - Mandelstahm[1, 4] ->
          Mandelstahm[1, 2]
      };
      tot = tot /. {
        1/spPr[\"<12>[12]\"] :> -1/Mandelstahm[1, 2]
      }
    ]
  ];
  propMass = Lookup[First[Values[sel[[1]][\"Propagators\"]]], \"Mass\", \
None];
  If[propMass === None, tot,
    tot /. Mass[_Multiparticle] :> propMass
  ]
];
\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[4765]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5ab818e7-41ab-4431-b0ac-28b58bdc01da"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Four-fermion processes", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"349d915f-62b4-4df0-9d0f-76f3a722fae0"],

Cell["\<\
Each entry lists the expected amplitude for every EW mediator that \
contributes. Same-flavour processes include the T-channel template, so the \
Fermi minus between S and T is tested.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"391c4927-4ddf-4034-9854-19de56886715"],

Cell["\<\

ffffTests = {
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> C c\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"C\", \
\"c\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Mc, Mc},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, Q2 -> 2/3}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Mc}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gL2 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gR2 \
-> gRu, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Mc} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> U u\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"U\", \
\"u\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Mu, Mu},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> ((ampffffASTested[] + ampffffATTested[]) /. {Q1 -> 2/3, Q2 -> \
2/3}),
      \"G\" :> ((ampffffASTested[] + ampffffATTested[]) /. {Q1 -> 1, Q2 -> 1, \
EE -> GG}),
      \"h\" :> ((ampffffhSTested[] + ampffffhTTested[]) /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> \
Mu}),
      \"Z\" :> ((ampffffZSTested[] + ampffffZTTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLu, gL2 \
-> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gR2 -> gRu, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Mu} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> S s\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"S\", \
\"s\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Ms, Ms},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, Q2 -> -1/3}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Ms}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gL2 -> gLd, gR2 \
-> gRd, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Ms} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> D d\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"D\", \
\"d\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Md, Md},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, Q2 -> -1/3}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gL2 -> gLd, gR2 \
-> gRd, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md} /. MW -> MZ*CW),
      \"W+\" :> (ampffffWTTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> S s\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"S\", \
\"s\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, Ms, Ms},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1/3, Q2 -> -1/3}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Md, M2 -> Ms}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, gL2 -> gLd, gR2 \
-> gRd, M1 -> Md, M2 -> Ms} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> D d\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"D\", \
\"d\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, Md, Md},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> ((ampffffASTested[] + ampffffATTested[]) /. {Q1 -> -1/3, Q2 -> \
-1/3}),
      \"G\" :> ((ampffffASTested[] + ampffffATTested[]) /. {Q1 -> 1, Q2 -> 1, \
EE -> GG}),
      \"h\" :> ((ampffffhSTested[] + ampffffhTTested[]) /. {M1 -> Md, M2 -> \
Md}),
      \"Z\" :> ((ampffffZSTested[] + ampffffZTTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 \
-> gRd, gL2 -> gLd, gR2 -> gRd, M1 -> Md, M2 -> Md} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> E e\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"E\", \
\"e\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Me, Me},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, Q2 -> -1}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Me}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gL2 -> gLe, gR2 \
-> gRe, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Me} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> Ne ne\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"Ne\", \
\"ne\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, gL2 -> 1, gR2 \
-> 0, M1 -> Mu, M2 -> 0} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> E e\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"E\", \
\"e\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, Me, Me},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1/3, Q2 -> -1}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Md, M2 -> Me}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, gL2 -> gLe, gR2 \
-> gRe, M1 -> Md, M2 -> Me} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> Ne ne\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"Ne\", \
\"ne\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, gL2 -> 1, gR2 \
-> 0, M1 -> Md, M2 -> 0} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> M m\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"M\", \
\"m\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, Mm, Mm},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> (ampffffASTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1, Q2 -> -1}),
      \"h\" :> (ampffffhSTested[] /. {M1 -> Me, M2 -> Mm}),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe, gL2 -> gLe, gR2 \
-> gRe, M1 -> Me, M2 -> Mm} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> E e\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"E\", \
\"e\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, Me, Me},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"A\" :> ((ampffffASTested[] + ampffffATTested[]) /. {Q1 -> -1, Q2 -> \
-1}),
      \"h\" :> ((ampffffhSTested[] + ampffffhTTested[]) /. {M1 -> Me, M2 -> \
Me}),
      \"Z\" :> ((ampffffZSTested[] + ampffffZTTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 \
-> gRe, gL2 -> gLe, gR2 -> gRe, M1 -> Me, M2 -> Me} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> Ne ne\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"Ne\", \
\"ne\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe, gL2 -> 1, gR2 \
-> 0, M1 -> Me, M2 -> 0} /. MW -> MZ*CW),
      \"W+\" :> (ampffffWTTested[] /. {M1 -> Me, M2 -> 0})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne Ne -> Nm nm\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"Ne\", \"Nm\", \
\"nm\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, 0, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffffZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> 1, gR1 -> 0, gL2 -> 1, gR2 -> 0, \
M1 -> 0, M2 -> 0} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne Ne -> Ne ne\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"Ne\", \"Ne\", \
\"ne\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, 0, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> ((ampffffZSTested[] + ampffffZTTested[]) /. {gL1 -> 1, gR1 -> \
0, gL2 -> 1, gR2 -> 0, M1 -> 0, M2 -> 0} /. MW -> MZ*CW)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u D -> T b\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"D\", \"T\", \
\"b\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Md, Mtp, Mb},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"W+\" :> (ampffffWSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md, M3 -> Mtp, M4 -> \
Mb})
    }|>
};
\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[4851]:=",ExpressionUUID->"99305705-a5ae-44a0-b07b-c834ab657704"],

Cell["\<\
Additional processes from SM-4-point.nb (2 fermion + 2 boson, including \
channels that currently FAIL). Expected keys may be \"e:T\" / \"d:U\". \
Fermion T on Zh and Wh sets FermionTRewrite. FAIL/TIMEOUT entries stay in \
the battery so they can be debugged.
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b81df4c4-701a-4dad-a790-e0b5a93e968b"],

Cell["\<\
otherTests = {
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> h h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"h\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, Mh, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffhhSTested[] /. M1 -> Me),
      \"e\" :> ((ampffhhTTested[] + ampffhhUTested[]) /. M1 -> Me)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> h h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"h\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, Mh, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffhhSTested[] /. M1 -> Mu),
      \"u\" :> ((ampffhhTTested[] + ampffhhUTested[]) /. M1 -> Mu)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> h h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"h\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, Mh, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffhhSTested[] /. M1 -> Md),
      \"d\" :> ((ampffhhTTested[] + ampffhhUTested[]) /. M1 -> Md)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> Z h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"Z\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, MZ, Mh},
    \"FermionTRewrite\" -> True,
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffZhZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe, M1 -> Me}),
      \"e:T\" :> (ampffZhfTTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe, M1 -> Me}),
      \"e:U\" :> (ampffZhfUTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe, M1 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> Z h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"Z\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, MZ, Mh},
    \"FermionTRewrite\" -> True,
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffZhZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, M1 -> Mu}),
      \"u:T\" :> (ampffZhfTTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, M1 -> Mu}),
      \"u:U\" :> (ampffZhfUTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu, M1 -> Mu})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> Z h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"Z\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, MZ, Mh},
    \"FermionTRewrite\" -> True,
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffZhZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, M1 -> Md}),
      \"d:T\" :> (ampffZhfTTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, M1 -> Md}),
      \"d:U\" :> (ampffZhfUTested[] /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd, M1 -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> Z Z\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"Z\", \
\"Z\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, MZ, MZ},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffZZhSTested[] /. M1 -> Me),
      \"e\" :> ((ampffZZfTTested[] + ampffZZfUTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLe, gR1 \
-> gRe, M1 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> Z Z\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"Z\", \
\"Z\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, MZ, MZ},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffZZhSTested[] /. M1 -> Mu),
      \"u\" :> ((ampffZZfTTested[] + ampffZZfUTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLu, gR1 \
-> gRu, M1 -> Mu})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> Z Z\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"Z\", \
\"Z\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, MZ, MZ},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffZZhSTested[] /. M1 -> Md),
      \"d\" :> ((ampffZZfTTested[] + ampffZZfUTested[]) /. {gL1 -> gLd, gR1 \
-> gRd, M1 -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> W- W+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"W-\", \
\"W+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, MW, MW},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffWWhSTested[] /. M1 -> Me),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffWWZSTested[] /. {M1 -> Me, gL1 -> gLe, gR1 -> gRe}),
      \"A\" :> (ampffWWASTested[] /. {M1 -> Me, Q1 -> -1}),
      \"ne:U\" :> (ampffWWfUTested[] /. {M1 -> Me, Mprop -> 0})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> W- W+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"W-\", \
\"W+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, MW, MW},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffWWhSTested[] /. M1 -> Mu),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffWWZSTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, gL1 -> gLu, gR1 -> gRu}),
      \"A\" :> (ampffWWASTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, Q1 -> 2/3}),
      \"d:T\" :> (ampffWWfTTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, Mprop -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> W- W+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"W-\", \
\"W+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, MW, MW},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"h\" :> (ampffWWhSTested[] /. M1 -> Md),
      \"Z\" :> (ampffWWZSTested[] /. {M1 -> Md, gL1 -> gLd, gR1 -> gRd}),
      \"A\" :> (ampffWWASTested[] /. {M1 -> Md, Q1 -> -1/3}),
      \"u:U\" :> (ampffWWfUTested[] /. Mprop -> Mu)
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne Ne -> W- W+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"Ne\", \"W-\", \
\"W+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, 0, MW, MW},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffWWZSTested[] /. {M1 -> 0, gL1 -> 1, gR1 -> 0}),
      \"e:T\" :> (ampffWWfTTested[] /. {M1 -> 0, Mprop -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne E -> W- h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"E\", \"W-\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, Me, MW, Mh},
    \"FermionTRewrite\" -> True,
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"W+\" :> (ampffWhWTested[] /. {M1 -> 0, M2 -> Me}),
      \"e:T\" :> (ampffWhfTTested[] /. {M2 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u D -> W- h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"D\", \"W-\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Md, MW, Mh},
    \"FermionTRewrite\" -> True,
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"W+\" :> (ampffWhWTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md}),
      \"d:T\" :> (ampffWhfTTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md}),
      \"u:U\" :> (ampffWhfUTested[] /. {M1 -> Mu, M2 -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne Ne -> Z h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"Ne\", \"Z\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, 0, MZ, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"Z\" :> (ampffZhZSTested[] /. {gL1 -> 1, gR1 -> 0, M1 -> 0})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"ne Ne -> Z Z\", \"Particles\" -> {\"ne\", \"Ne\", \"Z\", \
\"Z\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {0, 0, MZ, MZ},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"ne\" :> ((ampffZZfTTested[] + ampffZZfUTested[]) /. {gL1 -> 1, gR1 -> \
0, M1 -> 0})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> A.+ h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"A.+\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, 0, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"e:T\" :> (ampffAhTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1, M1 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> A.+ h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"A.+\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, 0, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"u:T\" :> (ampffAhTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, M1 -> Mu})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> A.+ h\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"A.+\", \
\"h\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Md, Md, 0, Mh},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"d:T\" :> (ampffAhTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1/3, M1 -> Md})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> A.+ A.+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"A.+\", \
\"A.+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"e:T\" :> (ampffApApTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1, M1 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"e E -> A.+ A.-\", \"Particles\" -> {\"e\", \"E\", \"A.+\", \
\"A.-\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Me, Me, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"e\" :> (ampffApAmTested[] /. {Q1 -> -1, M1 -> Me})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> A.+ A.+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"A.+\", \
\"A.+\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"u:T\" :> (ampffApApTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, M1 -> Mu})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"u U -> A.+ A.-\", \"Particles\" -> {\"u\", \"U\", \"A.+\", \
\"A.-\"},
    \"Masses\" -> {Mu, Mu, 0, 0},
    \"Expected\" -> {
      \"u\" :> (ampffApAmTested[] /. {Q1 -> 2/3, M1 -> Mu})
    }|>,
  <|\"Name\" -> \"d D -> A.+ A.+\", \"Particles\" -> {\"d\", \"D\", \"A.+\", \
